Description: CIT168 probabilistic subcortical atlas (Pauli et al. 2018) for
    the 'ggseg' ecosystem. Provides a 'ggseg_atlas' object with 2D polygon
    geometry and 3D mesh data, covering the striatum, pallidum and the small
    midbrain and diencephalic nuclei, for use with 'ggseg' and 'ggseg3d'.
